## Title
SitSmart

## Team Members
- Ayanna Garrett
- Logan Castelloe

Description

SitSmart is a babysitting app that connects parents with trusted babysitters in their area. Parents can search for available sitters, view profiles and reviews, and book babysitting services. Babysitters can create and manage their profiles, set their hourly rates, and update their availability and information over time.

App Functions
1. Parent (Customer Role)
- Create and manage a parent profile (sign up and login)
- Browse available babysitters by location and ratings
- View babysitter profiles, including reviews and details
- Book babysitters for specific dates and times
- Send and receive messages with babysitters
- Leave reviews based on experience

2. Babysitter (Provider Role)
- Create an account and build a babysitter profile
- Display profile information such as skills, experience, and hourly rate
- Update profile details and availability
- View and manage incoming bookings (accept/decline)
- Communicate with parents through messaging
- View reviews left by parents
- Project Structure

The project is split into two parts:

Frontend (HTML/CSS/JavaScript):
Handles all user interaction including login, browsing babysitters, booking, messaging UI, and profile management.

Backend (Spring Boot / REST API):
Manages data for parents, babysitters, bookings, reviews, and messages. It handles all CRUD operations and connects the frontend to the database.

Each role (parent and babysitter) has its own set of html, java, and JavaScript files to keep the functionality separate and organized.
